  "description": "Variation to condition 2 of planning approval&nbsp;2025/0123 to change the proposed roofing material from standing seam zinc to natural slates.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;All new external materials in respect of all the works hereby approved (and any other incidental works to be carried out in this connection) shall match the existing building in respect of materials used, detailed execution, and finished appearance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In the interests of the visual amenities of the surrounding area.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than 10 March 2028.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The development hereby approved shall provide a minimum of 2 Swift nesting bricks and/or boxes shall be provided at or close to eaves level of the development hereby approved. The bricks/boxes shall be retained thereafter in perpetuity.&nbsp;REASON: In the interests of biodiversity ",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>"
